---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title       = "Terms of Use | Rave Wellness";
const description = "Terms of use for ravewellness.org. This site provides harm reduction information for educational purposes only and is not a substitute for medical advice.";
const canonical   = "https://www.ravewellness.org/terms.html";
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description} {canonical} ogType="website">
  <Fragment slot="footer-nav">
    <h4>Legal</h4>
    <a href="/privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
    <a href="/terms.html">Terms of Use</a>
    <a href="/about.html">About</a>
  </Fragment>

  <main>
    <section style="padding: 80px 0 60px;">
      <div class="container" style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">

        <h1 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">Terms of Use</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 48px;">Last updated: May 15, 2026</p>

        <div class="prose">

          <p>By accessing or using ravewellness.org (the "Site"), you agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.</p>

          <h2>1. Educational information only</h2>
          <p>All content on this Site is provided for <strong>harm reduction and educational purposes only</strong>. Nothing on this Site constitutes medical advice, clinical guidance, or a recommendation to use, possess, or purchase any substance. The information is intended to reduce risk for people who have already decided to use substances, not to encourage or endorse drug use.</p>
          <p>Always consult a qualified healthcare provider for medical decisions. In a medical emergency, call your local emergency services immediately.</p>

          <h2>2. No liability</h2>
          <p>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Rave Wellness and its operators disclaim all liability for:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Any harm, injury, death, or loss arising from reliance on information published on this Site</li>
            <li>Inaccuracies, errors, or omissions in any content</li>
            <li>Your use or misuse of any substance, product, or technique described here</li>
            <li>Actions taken or not taken based on content found on this Site</li>
          </ul>
          <p>You use this Site and act on any information here <strong>entirely at your own risk</strong>. The Site is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of accuracy, completeness, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.</p>

          <h2>3. Controlled substances</h2>
          <p>Many substances discussed on this Site are controlled and illegal in most jurisdictions. Rave Wellness neither condones nor encourages illegal activity. You are solely responsible for knowing and complying with all laws applicable to you in your jurisdiction.</p>

          <h2>4. Age requirement</h2>
          <p>This Site is intended for adults (18 years of age or older). By using this Site you represent that you are at least 18 years old. We do not knowingly provide information to minors.</p>

          <h2>5. Affiliate links and commercial relationships</h2>
          <p>Some links on this Site are affiliate links. When you click an affiliate link and make a purchase, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. We have affiliate relationships with DanceSafe and Amazon Associates. These relationships do not influence our editorial recommendations. Pages containing affiliate links include a disclosure near the relevant links.</p>

          <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
          <p>All original content on this Site (text, design, code) is owned by Rave Wellness. You may share or quote content for non-commercial purposes with attribution and a link back to the source. You may not reproduce, republish, or commercially exploit content without written permission.</p>

          <h2>7. Third-party links and content</h2>
          <p>This Site links to third-party websites including DanceSafe, MAPS, TripSit, PubMed, and others. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of any third-party site. Links do not constitute endorsement beyond the specific harm reduction context in which they appear.</p>

          <h2>8. Accuracy and updates</h2>
          <p>We aim to keep content current and evidence-based, but drug science evolves and information may become outdated. We make no guarantee that any specific piece of content reflects the most current research. Dates on blog posts reflect when content was written or last reviewed, not a certification of ongoing accuracy.</p>

          <h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p>In no event shall Rave Wellness, its operators, authors, or contributors be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or related to your use of, or inability to use, this Site or any content on it, even if advised of the possibility of such damages. Some jurisdictions do not allow exclusion of certain warranties or limitation of liability, so some of these limitations may not apply to you.</p>

          <h2>10. Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these Terms at any time. Continued use of the Site after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision.</p>

          <h2>11. Governing law</h2>
          <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the United States, without regard to conflict of law principles. Any dispute arising under these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts located in the United States.</p>

          <h2>12. Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about these Terms: <a href="mailto:hello@ravewellness.org">hello@ravewellness.org</a></p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
